  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Joint NCA/SC FGM-CEFM Programme Phase IV - SEDHURO</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Joint Norwegian Church Aid (NCA) / Save the Children International (SCI) Female Genital Mutilation (FGM) and Child Early and Forced Marriage (CEFM) Programme &#x2013; Phase IV will be implemented by SEDHURO in Baledhawa, Dollow and Kismayo districts in Jubbaland State, Somalia. The project aims to contribute to the abandonment of FGM and CEFM by strengthening community-led prevention, awareness and behavior change initiatives, improving referral pathways to protection and support services for girls and women at risk, and engaging key influencers such as religious leaders, community leaders, parents, and youth.  Joint NCA/SC FGM-CEFM Programme Phase IV - SEDHURO</narrative>
  </description>
